#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Slide 2 - Mandatory event*\n"
msgstr "*投影片2 - 必要活動*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:56
msgid "Each funded projects has a series of milestones and a mandatory event that must be met."
msgstr "每個獲得資助的專案都設有一系列里程碑，以及一項強制必須達成的活動。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:58
msgid "The first is an mandatory event to occur 2026. Attendance by a project team member is required at the BID Capacity enhancement workshop for the respective region of the funded project. Attendance and travel for this event is funded by the programme and not the project. This workshop is technical in nature and the Project Lead should identify the best person to attend the workshop. The workshop participant will be expected to earn the digital certification associated with the workshop and will be responsible for disseminating the knowledge gained during the workshop to the project's stakeholders."
msgstr "第一項是將於 2026 年舉行的強制性活動。獲資助專案的專案團隊成員必須出席該專案所屬地區的 BID 能力提升工作坊。 此活動的出席及差旅費用由計畫經費支付，而非由專案經費負擔。該研討會屬技術性質，專案負責人應指派最適合的人選出席。研討會參與者須取得與該研討會相關的數位認證，並有責任將研討會期間所獲知識傳達給專案的利害關係人。"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "project-planning::mp3.png"
msgstr "project-planning::mp3.png"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Slide 3 - Reporting mid-term milestones*\n"
msgstr "*投影片 3 - 中期里程碑報告*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:64
msgid "Then there are mandatory milestones attached to phases of the project."
msgstr "此外，專案的各個階段還附帶必須達成的里程碑。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:66
msgid "The following must be completed for the Midterm report:"
msgstr "期中報告必須完成以下內容："

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:68
msgid "Publication of at least one dataset through GBIF.org"
msgstr "透過 GBIF.org 發布至少一個資料集"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:69
msgid "Gain certification at BID Capacity Enhancement Workshop"
msgstr "在 BID 能力提升工作坊取得認證"

