#, no-wrap
msgid "project-planning::mp4.png"
msgstr "project-planning::mp4.png"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Slide 4 - Monitoring plan*\n"
msgstr "*投影片4 - 監控計畫*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:75
msgid "In order to manage your timeline, it is important to define how you will monitor your progress. In this section of the proposal, you should describe:"
msgstr "為了管理您的時程，定義如何監控進度至關重要。在本提案的此部分，您應說明："

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:77
msgid "How you plan to monitor progress/achievement of the stated objectives and implementation of planned activities and production of deliverables;"
msgstr "您計畫如何監控所述目標的進度／達成狀況、已規劃活動的執行情況，以及交付成果的產出；"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:78
msgid "How you will evaluate immediate impact of your project;"
msgstr "您將如何評估該專案的立即影響；"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:79
msgid "How you will evaluate the longer-term impact of your project, for example 6-12 months after its completion."
msgstr "您將如何評估該專案的長期影響，例如在專案完成後 6 至 12 個月的情況。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:81
msgid "The role of the indicators in your monitoring plan"
msgstr "監測計畫中各項指標的作用"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "project-planning::mp5.png"
msgstr "project-planning::mp5.png"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Slide 5 - Mandatory indicators*\n"
msgstr "*投影片5 — 必要指標*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:87
msgid "As an additional measure of impact, you have…and should your project be funded you will be expected to report on the required indicators:"
msgstr "作為額外的衡量影響指標，您可參考…；若您的專案獲得資助，您將需針對規定的指標提交報告："

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Mandatory binary indicators (Yes/No)*\n"
msgstr "*必要二元指標（是／否）*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:91
msgid "Data mobilized contribute to relevant goals and targets of Global Biodiversity Framework (GBF)"
msgstr "流通的資料有助於實現《全球生物多樣性框架》（GBF）的相關目標與指標"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:92
msgid "Data mobilized support policy-relevant information products"
msgstr "流通的資料可支援與政策相關的資訊成果"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Mandatory quantitative indicators*\n"
msgstr "*必要定量指標*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:96
msgid "Number of institutions represented in events organized by the project"
msgstr "參與本專案所舉辦活動的機構數量"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:97
msgid "Number of people trained by the project"
msgstr "該專案所培訓的人數"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:98
msgid "Number of replication workshops organized by the project"
msgstr "本專案所舉辦的培訓工作坊場次數"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:99
msgid "Number of georeferenced species occurrence records published by the project"
msgstr "本專案所發表的、經地理參照的物種出現紀錄數量"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:101
msgid "If it helps you to monitor progress you can add additional indicators, You will then be able to select any other relevant capacity development indicators that should be used to assess the impact of your project. You may select as many as applicable."
msgstr "您可以新增其他指標以助於您監控專案進度；您將能選擇任何其他相關的能力發展指標，用以評估您專案的影響。您可以根據實際情況來選擇指標的數量。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:103
msgid "If your project is selected, you will be required to report on both the mandatory indicators and your chosen indicators in your midterm and final reports."
msgstr "若您的專案獲選，您將須在期中報告及最終報告中，分別針對必要指標及您的自選指標進行報告。"

