msgstr "project-planning::mp7.png"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Slide 7 - Examples of additional non-mandatory quantitative indicators*\n"
msgstr "*投影片7 — 其他非必要定量指標的範例*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:122
msgid "Examples of additional *non-mandatory quantitative indicators* to demonstrate the impact of data mobilization activities:"
msgstr "以下為：展示資料流通活動影響的額外 *非必要定量指標* 範例："

