#, no-wrap
msgid "project-planning::mp8.png"
msgstr "project-planning::mp8.png"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Slide 8 - Identification of risks and sustainability prospects*\n"
msgstr "*投影片8 — 風險辨別與永續發展前景*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:131
msgid "Lastly you will want to develop the section on sustainability prospects.  You should explain the approach that will be taken to ensure the long-term sustainability of the project’s impact (i.e. how will you sustain the project and its impacts after the funding is complete). This section should include potential risks that may prevent the successful realization of the project objectives and the details to possibly mitigate the risk."
msgstr "最後，您需要闡述關於永續發展前景的部分。  您應說明將採取何種方法來確保專案影響的長期永續性（即在資助金交付後，您將如何維持專案及其影響）。本節應包含可能阻礙專案目標順利實現的潛在風險，以及可能用以緩解該風險的具體措施。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:133
msgid "The identification of risks is an important step to assess and control areas of uncertainties and improve the chances of a project to succeed."
msgstr "風險識別是評估與控制不確定性領域，並提高專案成功機率的重要步驟。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:135
msgid "Mitigation strategies can be identified by answering questions such as; is there any possibility to:"
msgstr "透過回答以下問題，即可找出緩解策略，例如：是否有任何可能性："

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Avoid* the risk? If so, how? \n"
msgstr "*避免*這種風險？如果是這樣，該怎麼做？ \n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "If not, is it possible to *Reduce* the risk and its impact on the project? \n"
msgstr "如果不行，是否有可能*降低*該風險及其對專案的影響？ \n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "How can we *Manage* the risk? \n"
msgstr "我們該如何*管理*這項風險？ \n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "What are the processes we can implement to reduce the probability of the risk happening? \n"
msgstr "我們可以實施哪些流程來降低該風險發生的機率？ \n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:141
#, no-wrap
msgid "How can we downsize its overall impact on the project?\n"
msgstr "我們該如何降低其對專案的整體影響？\n"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "project-planning::mp9.png"
msgstr "project-planning::mp9.png"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:145
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Slide 9 - Project considerations*\n"
msgstr "*投影片9 - 專案考量事項*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:147
msgid "When you finish your proposal would should be able to answer these questions."
msgstr "完成提案後，您應該能夠回答以下這些問題。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:149
msgid "What are mandatory indicators?"
msgstr "何謂必要指標？"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:150
msgid "What are the project mandatory milestones?"
msgstr "專案的必要里程碑有哪些？"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:151
msgid "When are deliverables scheduled?"
msgstr "交付成果預計何時完成？"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:152
msgid "Is the timeline for producing deliverables, especially datasets, aligned with the project's mandatory milestones?"
msgstr "交付成果，尤其是資料集的產出時程，是否與專案的必要里程碑相符？"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:153
msgid "What will be included in your monitoring plan?"
msgstr "您的監控計畫將包含哪些內容？"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/measuring-progress.adoc:154
msgid "What tools and processes will you use to monitor progress, and how will you evaluate impact?"
msgstr "您將使用哪些工具和流程來監控進度，又將如何評估其影響？"

