msgid "Publication of data is something that we encourage you to start early, especially as your first dataset is a midterm reporting milestone, and then continue to publish datasets throughout the duration of your project.  Of course, some datasets naturally won't be ready for publication until nearer the end of the project."
msgstr "我們鼓勵您盡早開始發表資料，尤其因為您第一個資料集是期中報告的里程碑，也持續在專案進行期間發布資料集。當然，有些資料集理所當然的要等到專案接近尾聲時才能準備好發表。"

